 "code": "\nclass Component extends DCLogic {\n  componentDidMount() { this.subInit(); }\n\n  subTimer = null;\n  subInit() { return;\n    const st = this.state.subState || {};\n    if (localStorage.getItem('tcf_sub_dismissed') || localStorage.getItem('tcf_sub_done')) return;\n    this.subTimer = setTimeout(() => this.setState({ subOpen: true }), 30000);\n  }\n  subVals() {\n    return {\n      subOpen: !!this.state.subOpen, subDone: !!this.state.subDone, subPending: !this.state.subDone, subEmail: this.state.subEmail || '',\n      subChange: ev => this.setState({ subEmail: ev.target.value }),\n      subClose: () => { localStorage.setItem('tcf_sub_dismissed', String(Date.now())); this.setState({ subOpen: false }); },\n      subSubmit: ev => { ev.preventDefault(); localStorage.setItem('tcf_sub_done', '1'); this.setState({ subDone: true }); setTimeout(() => this.setState({ subOpen: false }), 2500); }\n    };\n  }\n  renderVals() {\n    const steps = [\n      ['approval', 'Confirm CTEC approval first', 'Only hours from a CTEC-approved provider count. Every school on California Tax Course Finder is checked against the registry, but if you find a course elsewhere, look up its provider number on CTEC.org before you pay.', 'What is your CTEC provider number?'],\n      ['cost', 'Compare the real price', 'List prices range from about $59 to $99 for 20-hour CE. Check what is included: exam retakes, printed materials, access period, and whether a coupon applies. A cheaper course that charges for a book or retakes can cost more.', 'Are there any fees beyond the list price?'],\n      ['format', 'Pick a format you will finish', 'Text-based courses are fastest if you read well and know the material. Video courses help if you want explanation. A printed book helps if you study offline. Live or instructor-led options exist for people who want structure.', 'Can I complete the whole course on my phone?'],\n      ['reporting', 'Check how fast hours are reported', 'Providers report completions to CTEC, not you. Most report within 1–3 business days; some take longer or require you to request it. Near the October 31 deadline, this matters.', 'How soon after I finish do you report to CTEC?'],\n      ['support', 'Know how to get help', 'Look for support hours that match when you study. Weekend and evening support is rare. Check whether instructor support is included or an upsell.', 'What are your support hours and channels?'],\n      ['refund', 'Read the refund policy', 'Policies range from 7 to 60 days, and some end once you start the course or take an exam. Know the terms before you enroll.', 'What is your refund window, and does starting the course void it?']\n    ].map(([id, title, body, ask], i) => ({ id, title, body, ask, n: i + 1, photo: id === 'format' }));\n    return { ...this.subVals(), steps };\n  }\n}\n",
