 "widget": "<div class=\"tcf-page tcf-scope tcf-p-how-to-choose-a-ctec-course\"><div id=\"tcf-how-to-choose-a-ctec-course-root\" class=\"tcf-root\">@@SSR@@</div></div>\n<template id=\"tcf-how-to-choose-a-ctec-course-tpl\">\n\n\n<div data-screen-label=\"How to Choose\" class=\"tcf-screen\">\n  \n  <div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;padding:110px 56px 100px\">\n    <img src=\"@@MEDIA:photos/ctec-course-comparison-laptop.webp@@\" alt=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(11,46,64,.96) 0%,rgba(11,46,64,.88) 55%,rgba(11,46,64,.78) 100%)\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 55%);\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;max-width:820px\">\n      <span style=\"align-self:flex-start;border:1px solid rgba(108,190,69,.5);color:#95AB3B;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Resources · 6 minute read</span>\n      <h1 style=\"margin:0;font:300 64px/1.05 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em\"><span style=\"display:block\">How to Choose</span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800\">a CTEC Tax Course <span style=\"color:#95AB3B\">That Fits</span></span></h1>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);max-width:640px;text-wrap:pretty\">Most CTEC courses cover the same required hours. The differences that matter are price after coupons, how you like to study, how fast hours get reported, and what happens if you need help.</p>\n    </div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"height:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#95AB3B,#7E9330)\"></div>\n  <div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;padding:88px 56px\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start\">\n      <div style=\"position:sticky;top:134px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font:600 19px Manrope,sans-serif\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3;padding:0 12px 10px\">In this guide</div><sc-for list=\"{{ steps }}\" as=\"s\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\"><a href=\"#{{ s.id }}\" style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#2F4652\" data-hv=\"13\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:#E3E9EB;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 17px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;flex:none\">{{ s.n }}</span>{{ s.title }}</a></sc-for></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\">\n        <sc-for list=\"{{ steps }}\" as=\"s\" hint-placeholder-count=\"6\">\n          <div id=\"{{ s.id }}\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:134px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\"><sc-if value=\"{{ s.photo }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><img src=\"@@MEDIA:photos/03-online-tax-course-desktop.webp@@\" alt=\"Desktop monitor displaying an online tax lesson beside study materials.\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/2;display:block;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:6px;box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(11,46,64,.12)\"></sc-if>\n            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:#0B2E40;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;flex:none\">{{ s.n }}</span><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">{{ s.title }}</h2></div>\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652\">{{ s.body }}</p>\n            <div style=\"background:#F3F5E6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:#7E9330\"><strong>Ask the provider:</strong> {{ s.ask }}</div>\n          </div>\n        </sc-for>\n        <div style=\"background:#0B2E40;color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px\"><div><div style=\"font:800 26px/1.2 Manrope,sans-serif\">Ready to compare?</div><div style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);margin-top:6px\">Every factor above is a column on our comparison.</div></div><a href=\"/#find-schools\" style=\"flex:none;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:8px\" data-hv=\"4\">See all providers</a></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n</div>\n  <sc-if value=\"{{ subOpen }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n  <div style=\"position:fixed;right:24px;bottom:24px;z-index:80;width:380px;max-width:calc(100vw - 32px);background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(11,46,64,.28);overflow:hidden;font-family:'Source Sans 3',sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">\n    <div style=\"height:5px;background:#95AB3B\"></div>\n    <div onclick=\"{{ subClose }}\" title=\"Close\" style=\"position:absolute;top:14px;right:12px;width:36px;height:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;color:#5A6E78\" data-hv=\"7\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18\"></path></svg></div>\n    <div style=\"padding:26px 26px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\">\n      <div style=\"font:700 15px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Monthly coupon codes</div>\n      <div style=\"font:800 26px/1.15 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em;padding-right:24px\">Get CTEC course coupon codes every month</div>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;color:#5A6E78\">New codes from different course providers each month, plus an alert when a sale starts. No spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p>\n      <sc-if value=\"{{ subDone }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\"><div style=\"background:#F3F5E6;border:1px solid #D7EDC8;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#7E9330\">You're in. Watch for this month's codes.</div></sc-if>\n      <sc-if value=\"{{ subPending }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n      <form onsubmit=\"{{ subSubmit }}\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\">\n        <input type=\"email\" required=\"\" value=\"{{ subEmail }}\" onchange=\"{{ subChange }}\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" style=\"height:50px;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:10px;padding:0 16px;font:400 17px 'Source Sans 3',sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;outline:none;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box\">\n        <button type=\"submit\" style=\"height:50px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;cursor:pointer\" data-hv=\"6\">Send me the codes</button>\n      </form>\n      </sc-if>\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px;color:#8A9AA3\">By subscribing you agree to our <a href=\"/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">Privacy Policy</a>.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  </sc-if>\n</template>",
 "css": "body{margin:0;background:#fff;font-family:\"Source Sans 3\",system-ui,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40}a{color:#7E9330;text-decoration:none}a:hover{color:#7E9330}a:visited{color:#7E9330}a:active{color:#7E9330}a:focus{outline:none}html{scrollbar-gutter:stable}button,select{font:inherit}button:focus,select:focus,input:focus{outline:none}.dd-menu a{display:flex!important;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}.dd .dd-menu{display:none}.dd:hover .dd-menu,.dd:focus-within .dd-menu{display:block}",
 "ssr": "\n\n\n<div data-screen-label=\"How to Choose\" class=\"tcf-screen\">\n  \n  <div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;color:#fff;padding:110px 56px 100px\">\n    <img src=\"/assets/photos/ctec-course-comparison-laptop.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(11,46,64,.96) 0%,rgba(11,46,64,.88) 55%,rgba(11,46,64,.78) 100%)\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.07) 0%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 55%);\"></div>\n    <div style=\"position:relative;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;max-width:820px\">\n      <span style=\"align-self:flex-start;border:1px solid rgba(108,190,69,.5);color:#95AB3B;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Resources · 6 minute read</span>\n      <h1 style=\"margin:0;font:300 64px/1.05 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em\"><span style=\"display:block\">How to Choose</span><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800\">a CTEC Tax Course <span style=\"color:#95AB3B\">That Fits</span></span></h1>\n      <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.55;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);max-width:640px;text-wrap:pretty\">Most CTEC courses cover the same required hours. The differences that matter are price after coupons, how you like to study, how fast hours get reported, and what happens if you need help.</p>\n    </div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"height:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#95AB3B,#7E9330)\"></div>\n  <div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;padding:88px 56px\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start\">\n      <div style=\"position:sticky;top:134px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font:600 19px Manrope,sans-serif\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8A9AA3;padding:0 12px 10px\">In this guide</div><a href=\"#approval\" style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#2F4652\" data-hv=\"13\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:#E3E9EB;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 17px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;flex:none\">1</span>Confirm CTEC approval first</a><a href=\"#cost\" style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#2F4652\" data-hv=\"13\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:#E3E9EB;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 17px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;flex:none\">2</span>Compare the real price</a><a href=\"#format\" style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#2F4652\" data-hv=\"13\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:#E3E9EB;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 17px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;flex:none\">3</span>Pick a format you will finish</a><a href=\"#reporting\" style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#2F4652\" data-hv=\"13\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:#E3E9EB;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 17px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;flex:none\">4</span>Check how fast hours are reported</a><a href=\"#support\" style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#2F4652\" data-hv=\"13\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:#E3E9EB;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 17px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;flex:none\">5</span>Know how to get help</a><a href=\"#refund\" style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:#2F4652\" data-hv=\"13\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:#E3E9EB;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 17px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40;flex:none\">6</span>Read the refund policy</a></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px\">\n        \n          <div id=\"approval\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:134px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:#0B2E40;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;flex:none\">1</span><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Confirm CTEC approval first</h2></div>\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652\">Only hours from a CTEC-approved provider count. Every school on California Tax Course Finder is checked against the registry, but if you find a course elsewhere, look up its provider number on CTEC.org before you pay.</p>\n            <div style=\"background:#F3F5E6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:#7E9330\"><strong>Ask the provider:</strong> What is your CTEC provider number?</div>\n          </div>\n        \n          <div id=\"cost\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:134px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:#0B2E40;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;flex:none\">2</span><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Compare the real price</h2></div>\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652\">List prices range from about $59 to $99 for 20-hour CE. Check what is included: exam retakes, printed materials, access period, and whether a coupon applies. A cheaper course that charges for a book or retakes can cost more.</p>\n            <div style=\"background:#F3F5E6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:#7E9330\"><strong>Ask the provider:</strong> Are there any fees beyond the list price?</div>\n          </div>\n        \n          <div id=\"format\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:134px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\"><img src=\"/assets/photos/03-online-tax-course-desktop.webp\" alt=\"Desktop monitor displaying an online tax lesson beside study materials.\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/2;display:block;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:6px;box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(11,46,64,.12)\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:#0B2E40;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;flex:none\">3</span><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Pick a format you will finish</h2></div>\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652\">Text-based courses are fastest if you read well and know the material. Video courses help if you want explanation. A printed book helps if you study offline. Live or instructor-led options exist for people who want structure.</p>\n            <div style=\"background:#F3F5E6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:#7E9330\"><strong>Ask the provider:</strong> Can I complete the whole course on my phone?</div>\n          </div>\n        \n          <div id=\"reporting\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:134px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:#0B2E40;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;flex:none\">4</span><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Check how fast hours are reported</h2></div>\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652\">Providers report completions to CTEC, not you. Most report within 1–3 business days; some take longer or require you to request it. Near the October 31 deadline, this matters.</p>\n            <div style=\"background:#F3F5E6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:#7E9330\"><strong>Ask the provider:</strong> How soon after I finish do you report to CTEC?</div>\n          </div>\n        \n          <div id=\"support\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:134px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:#0B2E40;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;flex:none\">5</span><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Know how to get help</h2></div>\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652\">Look for support hours that match when you study. Weekend and evening support is rare. Check whether instructor support is included or an upsell.</p>\n            <div style=\"background:#F3F5E6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:#7E9330\"><strong>Ask the provider:</strong> What are your support hours and channels?</div>\n          </div>\n        \n          <div id=\"refund\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:134px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,46,64,.06)\">\n            <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center\"><span style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:#0B2E40;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;flex:none\">6</span><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:800 26px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Read the refund policy</h2></div>\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652\">Policies range from 7 to 60 days, and some end once you start the course or take an exam. Know the terms before you enroll.</p>\n            <div style=\"background:#F3F5E6;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;color:#7E9330\"><strong>Ask the provider:</strong> What is your refund window, and does starting the course void it?</div>\n          </div>\n        \n        <div style=\"background:#0B2E40;color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px\"><div><div style=\"font:800 26px/1.2 Manrope,sans-serif\">Ready to compare?</div><div style=\"font-size:22px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);margin-top:6px\">Every factor above is a column on our comparison.</div></div><a href=\"/#find-schools\" style=\"flex:none;background:#95AB3B;color:#fff;font:700 22px Manrope,sans-serif;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:8px\" data-hv=\"4\">See all providers</a></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n</div>\n  \n"
}